WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
A man is hit by a poisoned arrow.

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:07.140
He refuses treatment until he
knows who shot him, and why.

3
00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:09.750
He dies before he finds out.

4
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:14.290
Some people say that asking about the
meaning of life can work the same way:

5
00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:16.110
it stops us living.

6
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.710
So does life need a God to have a point?

7
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.910
Or can you give it one yourself?

8
00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:24.380
In this mission, you'll explore
two great religious goals,

9
00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:28.450
salvation and liberation,
and the paths to each.

10
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.410
Then you'll meet non-religious thinkers,
and weigh up whether life has meaning

11
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.370
only for believers.

12
00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:38.350
Your mission: weigh up whether
life needs a God to have a point.
